-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ט/1: עדכון שכר למנהלים בעוז לתמורה
-- The "87 transition-to-reform" supplement of principals under Oz
-- LeTmura: linked to the index from 1.1.2018 and raised on 1.9.2018 and
-- 1.9.2019, under the agreement of 14.3.2018 (section 18 of circular
-- תשע"ח/3).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ט/1 עדכון שכר למנהלים בעוז לתמורה`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 akn:hc_1/p13 The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting, subject line and the recital that the agreement of 14.3.2018 was signed; no rule.

DECLARE `principal` HAS
    `a principal employed under Oz LeTmura` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ¶14: the supplement of principals under Oz LeTmura is updated as
-- follows; the amounts are linked under section 8.2 of the agreement and
-- section 4(d) of the agreement of 23.3.2017, December 2017's index
-- against December 2015's.
@ref akn:hc_1/p14
GIVEN `index of December 2017` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2015` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` `index of December 2017` `index of December 2015` IS
    `index of December 2017` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2015`

@desc A step of the supplement: from when, and its monthly amount.
DECLARE `supplement step` HAS
    `step from`      IS A DATE
    `step increase`  IS A NUMBER @desc the increase the clause states; 0 where it states none
    `step amount`    IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:hc_1__para_1 akn:hc_1__para_2 akn:hc_1__para_3
`the steps of the 87 transition supplement` MEANS
    LIST `supplement step` (Date 1 1 2018) 0      88.70,
         `supplement step` (Date 1 9 2018) 460.92 549.62,
         `supplement step` (Date 1 9 2019) 460.92 1010.54

-- The rest of the supplement's rules are unchanged (each clause).
@export default The monthly "87 transition-to-reform" supplement of a principal under Oz LeTmura on a given day, under the owners' circular 5779/1
@ref akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1__para_1 akn:hc_1__para_2 akn:hc_1__para_3
GIVEN p IS A `principal` @desc the principal
      `the day` IS A DATE @desc the day the supplement is paid for
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement` p `the day` IS
    IF p's `a principal employed under Oz LeTmura`
    THEN sum (map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `step amount`)
                  (take 1 (reverse (filter (GIVEN s YIELD `the day` AT LEAST s's `step from`)
                                           `the steps of the 87 transition supplement`))))
    ELSE 0

-- ¶1: 88.70 "instead of 88.52 as paid for that period": the difference owed
-- for each month from 1.1.2018.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1
`the monthly difference owed from 1.1.2018` MEANS 88.70 MINUS 88.52

DECLARE `supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the 87 transition supplement` HAS `supplement paid` IS A NUMBER
    `indemnify the owner under payments topic 558` HAS `indemnity paid` IS A NUMBER

-- ¶14: "יש לעדכן" — the owners must update the supplement of principals
-- under Oz LeTmura as each clause sets it, with the difference for the
-- months since 1.1.2018 already paid at 88.52 (¶1). The circular names no
-- date by which the update must be made, so the duty has no deadline.
@ref akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1__para_1
GIVEN p IS A `principal`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `updating the supplement` p `the day` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the 87 transition supplement` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the 87 transition supplement` p `the day`

-- ¶15: indemnity in the payments system, topic 558; no date is named.
@ref akn:hc_1/p15
GIVEN `indemnity due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `supplement action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owners` `indemnity due` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `indemnify the owner under payments topic 558` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `indemnity due`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Examples. Each step's increase brings the previous amount to the next.
`each increase adds up to the next amount` MEANS
    all (GIVEN pair YIELD pair's fst's `step amount` PLUS pair's snd's `step increase` EQUALS pair's snd's `step amount`)
        (zip (take 2 `the steps of the 87 transition supplement`) (drop 1 `the steps of the 87 transition supplement`))
#ASSERT `each increase adds up to the next amount`

`a principal under Oz LeTmura` MEANS `principal` WITH `a principal employed under Oz LeTmura` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement` `a principal under Oz LeTmura` (Date 1 10 2018) EQUALS 549.62
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement` `a principal under Oz LeTmura` (Date 1 9 2019) EQUALS 1010.54
-- Before 1.1.2018 this circular sets no amount (0 here means "not set by this circular").
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement` `a principal under Oz LeTmura` (Date 1 12 2017) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the monthly difference owed from 1.1.2018` EQUALS 0.18

#TRACE `indemnifying the owners` 100 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `indemnify the owner under payments topic 558` 100 AT 1
#TRACE `updating the supplement` `a principal under Oz LeTmura` (Date 1 10 2018) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the 87 transition supplement` 549.62 AT 1
